      "content": "SP 90 NW      CHOLESBURY-CUM-ST. LEONARDS      CHOLESBURY                                                (south side) 2/65                                           High Chimneys - -                                              II Small house. C17 altered.  Rendered and painted.  Old tile roof.  Large brick chimney at west end.  One storey and attic, two swept dormers, 2-light leaded casement on left, 3-light wood casement on right central door,  2-light casement each side.  Slightly lower wing on west with swept dormer and one casement.   RCHM I p 108 MON 5. Listing NGR: SP9319507059"
